### 使用说明
### 1. 安装 VS Code 插件 REST Client: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=humao.rest-client
### 2. 点击每个请求上方的 Send Request 执行
### 3. 第 1 步执行后，Mcp-Session-Id 会自动传递给后续请求（通过 {{initialize.response.headers.Mcp-Session-Id}}）

@host = http://localhost:8080
@endpoint = {{host}}/mcp

###
# 第 1 步：初始化连接，获取 Mcp-Session-Id
# @name initialize
POST {{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream, application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-11-25",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "test-client",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

###
# 第 2 步：获取工具列表（Session-Id 自动从第 1 步获取）
# @name listTools
POST {{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream, application/json
Mcp-Session-Id: {{initialize.response.headers.Mcp-Session-Id}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}

###
# 第 3 步：调用 getWeather 工具（Session-Id 自动从第 1 步获取）
# @name callWeather
POST {{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream, application/json
Mcp-Session-Id: {{initialize.response.headers.Mcp-Session-Id}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "getWeather",
    "arguments": {
      "cityName": "大连"
    }
  }
}
